OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A'Bold and inventive' Canadian poet Anne
OL,4,ACarson wins Nobel Literature Prize
OL,5,
OL,6,FCarson responded by joking that the
OL,7,Fjudges were "crazy" for honouring her.
OL,8,F"I think they're all crazy... Well, you
OL,9,Fknow, it's crazy," she told public
OL,10,Fbroadcaster RUV in Iceland, where she
OL,11,Fis currently staying.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
