OL,3,AActor Simon Pegg reveals ADHD
OL,4,Adiagnosis: 'It's just who I am'
OL,5,
OL,6,FADHD symptoms focus on three main areas
OL,7,F- inattention, hyperactivity and
OL,8,Fimpulsivity plus lack of concentration.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
